§ 25. DEPENDENCIAS DIRECTAS E INDIRECTAS
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

  Directas:
    argon2            0.5.3     Argon2id KDF
    aes-gcm           0.10.3    AES-256-GCM cipher
    rand              0.10.1    CSPRNG (ChaCha12 + getrandom)
    hex               0.4.3     Hex encoding
    pyo3              0.28.3    Python-Rust bridge

  Indirectas (árbol de dependencias):
    aes-gcm → aead, cipher, aes (AES-NI), polyval (GHASH)
    argon2  → password-hash, blake2, blake2b_simd
    rand    → rand_core, getrandom, chacha12
    pyo3    → libffi, parking_lot, once_cell

